    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Catolonizer</strong> \u2013 an exciting online social deduction game for up to 15 players! Complete tasks to earn coins, deceive others, uncover secrets, and decide who you can trust.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player has a hidden role: <strong>Catolonizer</strong>, <strong>Suspect</strong>, or <strong>Neutral</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catolonizers aim to protect the colony, Suspects must eliminate everyone without getting caught, and Neutrals pursue their own unique objectives.<br>Earn coins by completing tasks, purchase items from the Merchant, and use strategic actions at night to shift the balance of the game.<br>Be careful \u2014 every night brings new surprises!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Chaos:</strong> Engage in intense deception and survival matches with up to 15 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Your Hidden Ability:</strong> Every player has a secret item that determines what actions they can take at night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Social Deduction Gameplay:</strong> Discuss, strategize, and vote to figure out who can be trusted.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Matches:</strong> Each game plays out differently depending on the choices made by you and your friends.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you outsmart your opponents and lead your team to victory?<br>Join the Catolonizer community and find out!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Catolonizer</strong> \u2013 an exciting online social deduction game for up to 15 players! Complete tasks to earn coins, deceive others, uncover secrets, and decide who you can trust.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player has a hidden role: <strong>Catolonizer</strong>, <strong>Suspect</strong>, or <strong>Neutral</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catolonizers aim to protect the colony, Suspects must eliminate everyone without getting caught, and Neutrals pursue their own unique objectives.<br>Earn coins by completing tasks, purchase items from the Merchant, and use strategic actions at night to shift the balance of the game.<br>Be careful \u2014 every night brings new surprises!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Chaos:</strong> Engage in intense deception and survival matches with up to 15 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Your Hidden Ability:</strong> Every player has a secret item that determines what actions they can take at night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Social Deduction Gameplay:</strong> Discuss, strategize, and vote to figure out who can be trusted.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Matches:</strong> Each game plays out differently depending on the choices made by you and your friends.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you outsmart your opponents and lead your team to victory?<br>Join the Catolonizer community and find out!</p>",
